Upgrading is a deliberate change in a release, so every Reviewer on a release
sees diagrams drawn the same way:

  npm pack mermaid@<version>
  tar xzf mermaid-<version>.tgz
  gzip -9 -n -c package/dist/mermaid.min.js > internal/daemon/mermaid/mermaid.min.js.gz
  cp package/LICENSE internal/daemon/mermaid/LICENSE

then set mermaidVersion in internal/daemon/browserdiagram.go, and update this
file's version, source, integrity and checksums.
